			"notes": "![alpha 1.4.0](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/86dd52b21b09cc2dfd006b65e9833c856f3c4eac.png)\n\n#\n**New:**\n- Added a new item 'Piece Template'\n- Added a basic set for the following blocks:\n\t- Lamp\n\t- Blackstone\n\t- Soul Sand\n\t- Soul Soil\n\t- Calcite\n\t- Tuff\n\t- Obsidian\n\t- Crying Obsidian\n\t- Prismarine\n\t- Prismarine Bricks\n\t- Dark Prismarine\n\t- Smooth Basalt\n\t- Cherry Leaves\n\t- Light Gray Glazed Terracotta\n\t- Gray Glazed Terracotta\n\n! The basic set is a set of blocks consisting of Stairs, Slab and Vertical Slab\n- Now you can completely trim the bark from all types of Oak Wood blocks\n\n**Changes:**\n- The funnel interface has been removed\n- All content of Old Camouflage Blocks has been removed (In the future, all this content will be as a separate mod/addon)\n- Candles can now be placed underwater\n- Changed Id tags for Error Blocks and Debug Blocks (secrets_blocks)\n- Fixed the translation of blocks like 'Flowing Azalea Leaves' (ru)\n- Changed the strength and explosion resistance of all blocks like 'Pale Moss' and 'Resin' \n\n**Bug fixed:**\n- Bedrock Chest is now not destroyed by Wither\n- Fixed showing through slabs in the full block"
		},
