			"notes": "![alpha 1.3.0](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/24a612c03ee5fb5469d0a4a7f9fb612419e32ca7.png)\n\n# Copper Update:\n#\n\n**New:**\n- Added all color options for wool and concrete (Stairs, Slabs and Vertical Slabs)\n- Added Stairs, Slab and Vertical Slabs for the following blocks:\n\t- Cut Copper\n\t- Chiseled Copper\n\t- Copper Bulb\n\t- Raw Iron, Copper, Gold\n\t- Gold Block\n\t- Copper Ore and Deepslate Copper Ore\n- Added the ability to trim the bark of oak wood\n\n**Changes:**\n- Minor changes in the Russian localization\n- Unused textures have been removed\n- The textures of the templates have been changed\n- The tab icon has been changed: Old Camouflage Blocks\n- Hip blocks are now unbreakable from Weather and Ender Dragon\n- The explosion resistance of all wooden blocks has been changed\n- Changed the spelling of English words in localization\n- The explosion resistance of the leaf blocks has been changed\n- The explosion resistance of Basalt has been changed\n\n**Bug fixes:**\n- Incorrect explosion resistance and durability of Stripped Oak Wood Fence Gate has been fixed"
