			"notes": "![CAMOUFLAGE BLOCKS](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b08ec5c8c6151a5222655214876df4a163ecb8e0.png)\n\n**New:**\n- Added a few missing blocks for some kits:\n\t- Spruce Log and Wood\n\t- Honeycomb\n\t- Packed Mud, and more\n- Added a set of:\n    - Mud Bricks\n    - Old Diamond Block\n    - Red Sand\n    - Flowering Azalea Leaves\n- Added recipe for Redstone Lantern and Template Redstone Lantern. Yes, you can now get this flashlight in survival mode.\n- Added a complete set of recipes for blocks: oak log, amethyst\n\n**Changes:**\n- The model of Honey Skull and Honey Decorated Pot has been changed, now you can see the second layer of honey inside, like the original block.\n- The Redstone Torch model has been changed, now the second layer of redstone is similar to the original torch\n- The Decorated Pot model has been changed, now the first- and third-person view is similar to the original Decorated Pot. Now the Skulls don't conflict with the Decorated Pot texture on the top.\n- Changed the explosion resistance for Azalea Leaves\n\n**Corrections:**\n- Fixed incorrect recipe for amethyst steps and incorrect arrangement of ingredients\n- Azalea Leaves Grindstone is now visible in the creative mode tab\n- Fixed the Snow Lightning Rod hitbox\n- Fixed the id and name for the Powder Snow Button\n\t- id: powder_button > powder_snow_button\n\t- name: Powder Button > Powder Snow Button"
